  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrating Youth Voices in the CCA and CF Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh UNCT is revising the CCA to reflect significant economic and social changes in the country since the preparation of the last CCA (during COVID). One of the areas that needs to be strengthened is the integration of youth voices into the CCA &#x2013; both in terms of a more inclusive process and in developing partnerships with youth in the implementation of the Cooperation Framework.
The UNCT has established a Technical Working Group on Adolescents and Youth (TWG-AY) chaired by UNESCO.</narrative>
  </description>
